### Expert Listing API — request collection
### Point @baseUrl at local or production before running any request below.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
# @baseUrl = https://expert-listing-backend.vercel.app/api/v1

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Unknown route -> 404 envelope
GET {{baseUrl}}/nope

### Request id echoed when supplied
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
X-Request-Id: my-test-id

### --- GET /posts -------------------------------------------------------

### Basic shape: 3 hydrated items, pagination present
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?limit=3

### Default limit (20)
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts

### Filter: single post_type
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?post_type=property

### Filter: csv post_type
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?post_type=property,request

### Filter: transaction_type
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?transaction_type=for_rent

### Filter: has_media=true
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?has_media=true

### Filter: has_media=false
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?has_media=false

### Filter: min_bedrooms
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?min_bedrooms=3

### Filter: posted_within
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?posted_within=24h

### Two filters combine with AND
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?post_type=property&transaction_type=for_rent

### Filters persist across a cursor page (run once, copy pagination.next_cursor
### from the response into the cursor param below, keeping post_type)
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?post_type=property&limit=2

### GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?post_type=property&limit=2&cursor=<paste next_cursor here>

### Pagination sweep manually, page 1 of N (limit=7)
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?limit=7

### --- Errors -------------------------------------------------------------

### Malformed cursor -> 400 INVALID_CURSOR
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?cursor=garbage

### Invalid enum value -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR with field_errors
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?post_type=nonsense

### Unknown query param -> 400 (schema is .strict())
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?unknown_param=x

### limit=999 clamps to 50 (pagination.limit will read 50)
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?limit=999

### limit=0 -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?limit=0

### min_price > max_price -> 400 with a field error
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?min_price=500&max_price=100

### --- POST /posts/:id/like ------------------------------------------------
### Replace {{postId}} with a real post id (e.g. from GET /posts?limit=1).

@postId = 20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Bare toggle: flips whatever the current state is
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{postId}}/like

### Bare toggle again: flips back
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{postId}}/like

### Explicit like — idempotent, run twice for an identical response
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{postId}}/like
Content-Type: application/json

{"action":"like"}

### POST {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{postId}}/like  (run the same body again — identical response)

### Explicit unlike — idempotent, run twice for an identical response
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{postId}}/like
Content-Type: application/json

{"action":"unlike"}

### A different viewer sees an independent like state
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{postId}}/like
X-User-Id: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
Content-Type: application/json

{"action":"like"}

### --- POST /posts/:id/like errors ------------------------------------------

### Nonexistent post -> 404 POST_NOT_FOUND
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/like

### Malformed uuid -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR, never 404 or 500
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts/not-a-uuid/like

### Unknown body key -> 400 (schema is .strict())
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{postId}}/like
Content-Type: application/json

{"like":true}

### Invalid action value -> 400 with field_errors
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{postId}}/like
Content-Type: application/json

{"action":"unliked"}

### Absent body -> 200, toggles
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{postId}}/like
Content-Type: application/json

### --- GET /posts/:id/comments -----------------------------------------------
### post 2 from the design has exactly 7 comments (one is a reply)
@commentedPostId = 20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002

### Root comments only, newest first
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{commentedPostId}}/comments

### sort=oldest reverses the order
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{commentedPostId}}/comments?sort=oldest

### Pagination sweep manually, page 1 of N (limit=2)
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{commentedPostId}}/comments?limit=2

### --- GET /posts/:id/comments errors ------------------------------------------

### Nonexistent post -> 404 POST_NOT_FOUND, NOT an empty array
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/comments

### Malformed cursor -> 400 INVALID_CURSOR
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{commentedPostId}}/comments?cursor=garbage

### --- POST /posts/:id/comments -----------------------------------------------

### Basic create: 201, full comment, post_comment_count
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{commentedPostId}}/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{"body":"Is the parking secured?"}

### Idempotent create — run twice with the same client_token for an identical id
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{commentedPostId}}/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{"body":"double tap test","client_token":"tok-abc12345"}

### POST {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{commentedPostId}}/comments (same body again — same comment id)

### Valid reply (replace parent_comment_id with a real root comment id)
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{commentedPostId}}/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{"body":"Yes, gated compound.","parent_comment_id":"<root-comment-id>"}

### --- POST /posts/:id/comments errors ------------------------------------------

### Reply to a reply -> 409 MAX_REPLY_DEPTH, never 500
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{commentedPostId}}/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{"body":"grandchild","parent_comment_id":"<a-reply-id>"}

### Parent from a different post -> 400 with field parent_comment_id
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{postId}}/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{"body":"wrong post","parent_comment_id":"<root-comment-id-from-another-post>"}

### Nonexistent parent -> 404 PARENT_COMMENT_NOT_FOUND
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{commentedPostId}}/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{"body":"x","parent_comment_id":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"}

### Nonexistent post -> 404 POST_NOT_FOUND
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{"body":"x"}

### Empty body -> 400 with field_errors on "body"
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{commentedPostId}}/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{"body":""}

### Whitespace-only body -> 400 with field_errors on "body"
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{commentedPostId}}/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{"body":"   "}

### Unknown body key -> 400 (schema is .strict())
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{commentedPostId}}/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{"body":"x","extra":1}

### client_token under 8 chars -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{commentedPostId}}/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{"body":"x","client_token":"short"}

